  "description": "SIRMEO crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H100 Dy8 N16 O50,13(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1C (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2C (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.578-5.128 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.69-179.65°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy8(μ3-O)4(L)8(CH3COO)4(CO3)2]·13H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
